        "b": 408.80610136319495
      },
      "content": "According to detail requirements on site, auxiliary connection may be needed for UPS to realize management  of  battery  system  (battery  temperature  sensor),  communication  with  personal computers, provision of alarming signals to external devices or remote emergency power off, etc. These functions are realized by monitoring panel locating at the back of the front door of UPS and communication port module. The monitoring panel can provide the following ports:"
    },
